@startuml
[*] --> Unauthenticated : Initial State
Unauthenticated --> Created : Account Creation
Created --> Watching : Video Viewing
Watching --> Uploading : Video Upload
Uploading --> Watching : Continue Watching
Watching --> Viewing Likes List : Save to Likes List
Viewing Likes List --> Created : Return from Viewing Saved Videos
Created --> In Discussion : Enter Discussion Option

[*] --> Created : Initial State (after account creation)
Created --> [*] : Logout or Closure

@enduml
